kers, shifts, assigned zones, active ticket counts).\n  * Dispatch scoring algorithm that selects the worker with the lowest workload in the matching department and zone.\n  * Auto-assigns the ticket immediately upon ingestion.\n* **Frontend Accomplishment:**\n  * Dedicated **Worker Portal** where field teams log in to view their personal queue of assigned tasks and update status.\n  * Supervisor view allowing manual reassignment if a worker is unavailable.\n\n---\n\n### **Version 4.0 — SLA Tracking \u0026 Automated Escalation Engine**\n* **Milestone Goal:** Introduce time accountability by tracking resolution deadlines and automatically escalating neglected tickets up the management ladder.\n* **Backend Accomplishment:**\n  * SLA deadline calculation engine tied to ticket priority (4h, 12h, 24h, 72h).\n  * Background cron/scheduler checking open tickets continuously.\n  * Multi-tier escalation triggers: warnings before deadline, Level 1 escalation to Supervisor on breach, Level 2 escalation to Department Head after 24h breach.\n* **Frontend Accomplishment:**\n  * Live color-coded SLA countdown timers on the Worker and Supervisor interfaces.\n  * High-visibility **Breach Alert Banner** on the Supervisor screen showing overdue tickets highlighted in red.\n\n---\n\n### **Version 5.0 — Verification, Quality Loop \u0026 Duplicate Handling**\n* **Milestone Goal:** Complete the resolution verification cycle with evidence upload, user sign-off/reopen capabilities, and duplicate complaint prevention.\n* **Backend Accomplishment:**\n  * Duplicate detection check comparing incoming complaints against active tickets in the same location.\n  * Verification state machine: Handles `Resolved` → `Closed` (if confirmed) or `Re-opened` (if rejected).\n  * Auto-closure timer if a user fails to confirm resolution within 48 hours.\n* **Frontend Accomplishment:**\n  * Worker completion screen to submit resolution notes and proof-of-work photos.\n  * User verification prompt where complainants approve the fix or request a rework with notes.\n  * Star-rating feedback widget upon ticket closure.\n\n---\n\n### **Version 6.0 — Master Operations Command Center \u0026 Analytics**\n* **Milestone Goal:** Institutional administrative dashboard providing real-time operational visibility, performance metrics, and bottleneck identification.\n* **Backend Accomplishment:**\n  * Analytics engine calculating departmental on-time resolution percentages, average fix times, and recurring issue hotspots.\n  * Real-time notification and status update broadcasting.\n  * Data export utilities (CSV/PDF reports for administrative reviews).\n* **Frontend Accomplishment:**\n  * **Master Admin Dashboard** with metric cards (Total Volume, Breach Rate, Department Breakdown).\n  * Department ranking and worker performance leaderboards.\n  * Interactive location map/filter showing clusters of active complaints across campus buildings.",
